window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Desperate to escape her narcissistic father’s shadow and start fresh in the UK, Ashlynn finds her plans shattered when her father’s shady dealings with an international art thief thrust her into peril.</p><p>Enter Steele: a criminal mastermind with a burning vendetta. His plan to kidnap Ashlynn and use her as leverage against his enemy quickly spirals out of control. Instead of the easy pawn he anticipated, he’s met with a fierce and spirited woman who challenges everything he thought he knew about himself.</p><p>As Steele grapples with his growing feelings for the fiery Ashlynn, he must confront his own dark desires. Torn between revenge and a burgeoning passion, can he keep his heart—and his plans—intact? And as Ashlynn navigates her new, dangerous reality, will she seek escape from Steele’s captivating embrace or find herself entangled in a web of unexpected emotions?</p><p>In this intense, passionate tale of love, power, and betrayal, discover if two enemies can ever become allies—or something far more dangerous</p>"; 
